  "reading": {
    "zh": "一次 run 的四段：入口与选项（读什么、怎么跑）→ 静态分析（分词、循环结构、变量作用域、目标继承）→ 执行（逐条派发、输出捕获、重试）→ 产物（JSON 报告）。静态分析组里任何错误都会在任何命令执行之前带行号报出。",
    "en": "The four stages of one run: entry and options, static analysis (tokenising, loop structure, variable scopes, target inheritance), execution (dispatch, capture, retry), and the artefacts. Anything wrong in the analysis stage fails with a line number before a single command runs."
  },
